Subject: [PATCH] Add avatar picker (male/female) to Profile Form

---
 app/public/avatars/README.md        | 12 ++++++
 app/src/components/AvatarPicker.jsx | 60 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 app/src/screens/ProfileForm.jsx     |  8 ++++
 app/src/store.js                    |  2 +-
 4 files changed, 81 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 app/public/avatars/README.md
